    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let The Catnip Coma Begin!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a young cat on an intense mental journey through his cloudy glitch aesthetic mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More\u2026 MORE!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect enough catnip to progress to the next level. Collect up to 1000 catnip flowers across 10 levels. Each catnip is guarded by enemies that can be defeated with your kick attacks. More attacks are unlocked as you proceed through the first five levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why Can\u2019t He Talk?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look at flashbacks and conversations with your subconscious as the trauma* unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474530/extras/b0c389cea9f97c9d8bf5591c5d27630d.poster.avif?t=1752798473\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474530/extras/b0c389cea9f97c9d8bf5591c5d27630d.webm?t=1752798473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474530/extras/b0c389cea9f97c9d8bf5591c5d27630d.mp4?t=1752798473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Boss fights related to this will be added in a future build. Coming soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy With Up To Four Players</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See who can get the most catnip.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything unlocked in Story mode becomes available in Multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set the scope of each round with anywhere from 10 to 100 catnip per match!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energetic Earworms</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack is inspired by fast chiptune and breakcore with occasional moments of lofi hiphop!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With &quot;easy,&quot; &quot;normal,&quot; and &quot;hard&quot; difficulty settings, Catnip Fever Dreamland can be enjoyed by both casual and avid gamers alike! Stay tuned as even more features will be added in future builds!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let The Catnip Coma Begin!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a young cat on an intense mental journey through his cloudy glitch aesthetic mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More\u2026 MORE!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect enough catnip to progress to the next level. Collect up to 1000 catnip flowers across 10 levels. Each catnip is guarded by enemies that can be defeated with your kick attacks. More attacks are unlocked as you proceed through the first five levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why Can\u2019t He Talk?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look at flashbacks and conversations with your subconscious as the trauma* unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474530/extras/b0c389cea9f97c9d8bf5591c5d27630d.poster.avif?t=1752798473\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474530/extras/b0c389cea9f97c9d8bf5591c5d27630d.webm?t=1752798473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474530/extras/b0c389cea9f97c9d8bf5591c5d27630d.mp4?t=1752798473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Boss fights related to this will be added in a future build. Coming soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy With Up To Four Players</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See who can get the most catnip.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything unlocked in Story mode becomes available in Multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set the scope of each round with anywhere from 10 to 100 catnip per match!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energetic Earworms</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack is inspired by fast chiptune and breakcore with occasional moments of lofi hiphop!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With &quot;easy,&quot; &quot;normal,&quot; and &quot;hard&quot; difficulty settings, Catnip Fever Dreamland can be enjoyed by both casual and avid gamers alike! Stay tuned as even more features will be added in future builds!</strong></p>",
